<title>USA: AFTER THE BELL - After-hours quiet.</title>
<headline>AFTER THE BELL - After-hours quiet.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>After-hours trading was quiet on Friday, traders said.</p>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said its session one volume was 3,400 shares. There was no session two volume, the NYSE said.</p>
